  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve high accuracy (config_019: 0.639). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l (a stronger image encoder) while keeping other parameters the same (pca_n2000, multiprofile, avgpool, weighted fusion). This isolates the effect of the image encoder, a critical design choice, and could reveal if upgrading the image encoder further improves performance. It balances exploitation of the successful multiprofile setup with exploration of a key component."
}

